generic discharge; `frameSim_relocate` the witness seed). The shipped
0-based `becomeCandidate_handler_eq`/`_alloc` statements are
UNTOUCHED. Shared machinery reused verbatim: `uρ`/`uρ'`/`uKey1/2/3`/
